        {
          "name": "IDPSession",
          "longName": "IDPSession",
          "fullName": "idpsession.IDPSession",
          "description": "IDPSession represents a set of tokens returned by an upstream IDP\nfor a given user session obtained by sign-on.\nThey do not necessarily correspond one-to-one with a unique upstream IDP session.\nAn IDPSession's ID should be deterministically derived from the\nupstream IDP's user ID and some unique client identifying information (e.g. Browser).\nIDPSession's that share the same SID, correspond to the same upstream\nIDP session for that user. Otherwise, we treat an IDPSession as a unique\nupstream IDP session, although this is likely not the case in practice.",
